## Selection Rules

- Use the highest-frequency suitable lemma.
- Introduce a word only when the learner can immediately use it.
- Every core word must appear:
  - in the story,
  - in at least one exercise,
  - in SRS.
- Avoid introducing synonyms at A1 unless necessary.
- Prioritise usefulness over raw frequency when the two conflict.
